## 3. Console Variables (CVar) System

Decouple engine tuning parameters from recompilation cycles:
```cpp
class CVarSystem {
public:
    static void RegisterInt(const char* name, int defaultValue, const char* description);
    static void RegisterFloat(const char* name, float defaultValue, const char* description);
    static void RegisterBool(const char* name, bool defaultValue, const char* description);

    static int GetInt(const char* name);
    static float GetFloat(const char* name);
    static void Set(const char* name, const char* strValue);
};

// Usage in graphics engine:
static auto CVar_ShadowCascadeCount = CVarSystem::RegisterInt("r.shadows.cascades", 4, "Number of CSM cascades");
```
* **Autocomplete & Help Console:** Support command auto-completion, historical command navigation, and `cvar_name ?` documentation strings.

